    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<div style="margin:30px 0 14px">

  <p class="muted" style="margin:0">
    Your workspace
  </p>

  <h2 style="margin:3px 0">
    Study tools
  </h2>

</div>

<div class="grid tools-grid">

  <div class="card">

    <div class="tool-icon">📷</div>

    <h3>Camera</h3>

    <p class="muted">
      Your webcam and behavior analysis can run in the background while you study.
    </p>

    <button class="linkbtn"
            onclick="openCamera()">
      Open camera →
    </button>

    <div class="camera-status"
         id="cameraStatus">
      Starting camera…
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="card">

    <div class="tool-icon">🎙️</div>

    <h3>Dictation</h3>

    <p class="muted">
      Speak and turn your voice into text using your browser.
    </p>

    <button class="linkbtn"
            onclick="toggleDictation()">
      Start dictation →
    </button>

    <div class="camera-status"
         id="dictationStatus">
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="card">

    <div class="tool-icon">🔊</div>

    <h3>Lesson audio</h3>

    <p class="muted">
      Use built-in speech synthesis to hear study content aloud.
    </p>

    <button class="linkbtn"
            onclick="speakLesson()">
      Read lesson →
